        "created_at": "2018-10-12T03:24:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe I am blind to how this miniexpansion for the Void Guard works, but I am a bit confused by \"The Sentinels\" foil card that came with the Obilvaeon expansion. &nbsp;How does this card work? &nbsp;I got the rules sheet, but it is not clear to me how this single card works.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In addition, it refers to The Sentinels' Deck (the last paragraph of the rules insert), and I am not sure what this is refering to. &nbsp;Is this perhaps in an expansion I am missing where it addresses hero teams?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:03.022Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
