        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Maybe I am blind to how this miniexpansion for the Void Guard works, but I am a bit confused by \"The Sentinels\" foil card that came with the Obilvaeon expansion. &nbsp;How does this card work? &nbsp;I got the rules sheet, but it is not clear to me how this single card works.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In addition, it refers to The Sentinels' Deck (the last paragraph of the rules insert), and I am not sure what this is refering to. &nbsp;Is this perhaps in an expansion I am missing where it addresses hero teams?</p>",
